#: content/blog/2022-02-07-kde-eco-2021-sprint.md:12
msgid ""
"This is a follow-up to the [KDE Eco Sprint announcement posted on The Dot]"
"(https://dot.kde.org/2021/12/24/2021-kde-eco-sprint)."
msgstr ""
"Bu, [The Dot’ta yayınlanan KDE Eko Hız Koşusu duyurusunun](https://dot.kde."
